---
description: Airlock project conventions and task workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before any change, read `AGENTS.md`, then find your task in `PLAN.md`.
- Work one PLAN.md task at a time. Meet its "Done when" criteria, run the checks listed in
  PLAN.md, then flip its checkbox to `[x]` and append ` — done YYYY-MM-DD: <note>`.
- Record architectural choices in the PLAN.md "Decisions log".
- Never log, display, or commit raw secrets, stream keys, or private terms. Use `mask_evidence`.
- All timing uses media time (`Ts`, `Dur`, `Span` from airlock-core).
